  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      186.57,
      218.33,
      377.25,
      242.99
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT(CHAPTER 131)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      254.93,
      401.9,
      279.59
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      291.53,
      401.89,
      316.19
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Industrial Disputes(Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      328.13,
      401.9,
      392.63
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 46 of the Industrial Disputes Act(Chapter 131) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended by the repeal of subsections(1), (2) and (3) thereof, and the substitution therefor of thefollowing subsections:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      179.85,
      404.57,
      401.95,
      469.07
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(1) Any party to any proceeding under this Acttaken by or before any authorized officer, arbitrator,industrial court or labour tribunal or the Commissionermay, act through an Attorney-at-law or a representativeof the party.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      179.85,
      481.13,
      401.85,
      505.67
    ],
    "text": "(2) For the purposes of this Act, a representativeof a party shall\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      203.97,
      517.73,
      401.88,
      555.59
    ],
    "text": "(a) where the party is a trade union, or consistsof two or more trade unions, be a person torepresent such union or each such union;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      203.97,
      567.53,
      401.9,
      671.99
    ],
    "text": "(b) where the party consists partly of any tradeunion or unions and partly of employers orworkmen who are not members of any suchunion, be a person to represent such union orof each such union and a prescribed numberof persons nominated in accordance withregulations by such employers or workmen;and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
